<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8" standalone="yes"?><rss version="2.0" xmlns:atom="http://www.w3.org/2005/Atom"><channel><title>그룹·정렬·필터 on JsonXcel Learn</title><link>https://jsonxcel.github.io/learn-jsonxcel/ko/learn/m05-group-sort-filter/</link><description>Recent content in 그룹·정렬·필터 on JsonXcel Learn</description><generator>Hugo</generator><language>ko-KR</language><atom:link href="https://jsonxcel.github.io/learn-jsonxcel/ko/learn/m05-group-sort-filter/index.xml" rel="self" type="application/rss+xml"/><item><title>그룹 집계</title><link>https://jsonxcel.github.io/learn-jsonxcel/ko/learn/m05-group-sort-filter/m05-l01-group/</link><pubDate>Mon, 01 Jan 0001 00:00:00 +0000</pubDate><guid>https://jsonxcel.github.io/learn-jsonxcel/ko/learn/m05-group-sort-filter/m05-l01-group/</guid><description>&lt;blockquote&gt;
&lt;p&gt;이 페이지는 한국어 입구입니다. 상세 기술 설명은 당분간 영어/간체가 기준입니다. 마커·JSON 키·&lt;code&gt;template_name&lt;/code&gt;은 모든 언어에서 동일합니다.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/blockquote&gt;
&lt;h2 id="learning-objectives"&gt;Learning objectives&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Group a list field with &lt;code&gt;G=merge&lt;/code&gt; (default) so identical keys share one cell&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Contrast &lt;code&gt;G=repeat&lt;/code&gt; when every row should reprint the key&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Keep amount/detail columns as normal expanding fields beside the group key&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;aside
 class="jx-lesson-demo my-8 rounded-xl border border-slate-200 bg-slate-50/80 p-5 dark:border-slate-700 dark:bg-slate-900/60"
 data-jx-demo
 data-template-name="lesson_m05_group"
 data-language="ko-KR"
 data-api-base="https://api.jsonxcel.com:2053"
 data-site-root="https://jsonxcel.github.io/learn-jsonxcel"
 data-sample-url="https://jsonxcel.github.io/learn-jsonxcel/samples/ko-KR/lesson_m05_group.json"
 data-sample-kind="ds"
 data-template-url="https://jsonxcel.github.io/learn-jsonxcel/templates/ko-KR/lesson_m05_group.xlsx"
 data-mode="ds"
&gt;
 &lt;div class="flex flex-wrap items-baseline justify-between gap-2"&gt;
 &lt;p class="text-sm font-semibold text-slate-800 dark:text-slate-100"&gt;인터랙티브 레슨 데모&lt;/p&gt;</description></item><item><title>정렬</title><link>https://jsonxcel.github.io/learn-jsonxcel/ko/learn/m05-group-sort-filter/m05-l02-sort/</link><pubDate>Mon, 01 Jan 0001 00:00:00 +0000</pubDate><guid>https://jsonxcel.github.io/learn-jsonxcel/ko/learn/m05-group-sort-filter/m05-l02-sort/</guid><description>&lt;blockquote&gt;
&lt;p&gt;이 페이지는 한국어 입구입니다. 상세 기술 설명은 당분간 영어/간체가 기준입니다. 마커·JSON 키·&lt;code&gt;template_name&lt;/code&gt;은 모든 언어에서 동일합니다.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/blockquote&gt;
&lt;h2 id="learning-objectives"&gt;Learning objectives&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Apply &lt;code&gt;S=asc&lt;/code&gt; / &lt;code&gt;S=desc&lt;/code&gt; on a collection field marker&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Keep sibling columns on the same expanding row so they travel with the sorted key&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Prefer sorting in the template when the API payload order is unstable&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;aside
