 data-sample-kind="ds"
 data-template-url="https://jsonxcel.github.io/learn-jsonxcel/templates/ko-KR/lesson_m05_sort.xlsx"
 data-mode="ds"
&gt;
 &lt;div class="flex flex-wrap items-baseline justify-between gap-2"&gt;
 &lt;p class="text-sm font-semibold text-slate-800 dark:text-slate-100"&gt;인터랙티브 레슨 데모&lt;/p&gt;</description></item><item><title>필터 연산자</title><link>https://jsonxcel.github.io/learn-jsonxcel/ko/learn/m05-group-sort-filter/m05-l03-filter/</link><pubDate>Mon, 01 Jan 0001 00:00:00 +0000</pubDate><guid>https://jsonxcel.github.io/learn-jsonxcel/ko/learn/m05-group-sort-filter/m05-l03-filter/</guid><description>&lt;blockquote&gt;
&lt;p&gt;이 페이지는 한국어 입구입니다. 상세 기술 설명은 당분간 영어/간체가 기준입니다. 마커·JSON 키·&lt;code&gt;template_name&lt;/code&gt;은 모든 언어에서 동일합니다.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/blockquote&gt;
&lt;h2 id="learning-objectives"&gt;Learning objectives&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Know the &lt;code&gt;F=&lt;/code&gt; / filter expression syntax (&lt;code&gt;&amp;gt;&lt;/code&gt;, &lt;code&gt;AND&lt;/code&gt;, &lt;code&gt;OR&lt;/code&gt;, &lt;code&gt;LIKE&lt;/code&gt;, &lt;code&gt;NULL&lt;/code&gt;, …)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Understand that &lt;strong&gt;JsonXcel&amp;rsquo;s JSON &lt;code&gt;ds&lt;/code&gt; path does not accept &lt;code&gt;F=&lt;/code&gt; today&lt;/strong&gt; — the engine requires a table data source&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Prefer filtering in your application before convert until table binding is exposed&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
